Package: fmckage
Type: Package
Title: Personal Toolkit for Data Wrangling and R Code Auditing
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Francesco",
      family = "Monti",
      email = "58150610+FrancescoMonti-source@users.noreply.github.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: A personal collection of utilities carried across projects.
    Covers descriptive summaries and frequency tables, date and period
    handling, join and deduplication helpers, plot export, and a set of
    static code-audit tools that measure an R repository (cyclomatic
    complexity, call graph, unused abstractions) and place it against the
    distribution of the packages installed on the machine.
